  Description: Prerequisite Region - Golden Road Whether in Katapesh or one of the
    bustling markets along the Path of Salt, you've spent enough time buying and
    selling ancient or unusual items to give you an instinctive ability to quickly
    sort valuable trinkets from worthless baubles. Choose two attribute boosts. One
    must be to Intelligence or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost. You're
    trained in the Arcana skill and the Mercantile Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Quick
    Identification] skill feat.
